COMPILATION OF: E46M24

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   9 c        put file(outf) list(v,rec);
COMP REQ                               ?
    1 ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46M24

   1 a 0000 E46M24:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2b] THE SECOND-ITEM GUARD: the WHOLE ROW of an internal
   4 a 0006      structure in position 2. The first item is fully authorized, so
   5 a 0006      this isolates the structure-valued item. */
   6 c 0006   dcl outf file, v char(20) varying;
   7 c 0006   dcl 1 rec, 2 line char(14) varying, 2 nxt fixed bin(15);
   8 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('M24OUT DAT');
   9 c 0023   put file(outf) list(v,rec);
  10 c 0041   close file(outf);
  11 a 0047 end E46M24;

CODE SIZE = 004A
DATA AREA = 0030
FREE SYMS = 387D
END  COMPILATION
